<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλε-έω</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλέουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.Com.
					4.1
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλέησα</span>, 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέησα</span> (v. infr.):—
				Pass.
			, pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλέημαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					595.2
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλεος</span>):—<i>to have
				pity on, show mercy to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δ᾽ ἐρύσατο καί μ᾽ ἐλέησεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.279
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύ μ᾽ ἐλέησον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					501
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέησον αὐτῶν τὴν ὄπα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					400
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. [τινα] ἐπὶ τοῖς ἀκουσίοις παθήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τύχης τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
				</span></i>
			 Eph.<i><span class="en">
				5.4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				34c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				336e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ax.</u>
				368d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα . . ἧττον ὑφ᾽ ὑμῶν ἐλεοίμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					27.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμ᾽ ἠλέηται καὶ τέθνηκεν ἡ χάρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					595.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				844
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,<i>feel
				pity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				706
			</span></i>.</div>
